dialogs
0	Welcome to LILYCOVE MUSEUM.Please take the time to enjoy our collection of fantastic artwork featuring POKéMON.
2	Battling with POKéMON is fun, I'll grant you that.But one mustn't forget our love for the fine arts.
3	This ART MUSEUM… Well, you could see many fantastic paintings.And the CURATOR is a wonderful person.Among artists like myself, this MUSEUM is an inspiration.
4	This lady is pretty! She's like Mommy!
5	This POKéMON is adorable! Just like our little boy!
6	I'd heard that this ART MUSEUM got in some new paintings.So, naturally I hurried over.Are the new paintings up on the second floor?
7	I aim to see many great paintings here and learn from them.I have this dream of one day having my artwork exhibited here.
8	The ART MUSEUM has become a favorite tourist destination.It's great for LILYCOVE… No, great for the HOENN region!This is what I've heard--a lone TRAINER procured all the paintings upstairs.
9	Lately, the CURATOR has been unusually cheerful.I bet something good happened for him. Definitely.
